; Great House Farm / Tŷ Mawr — the farm’s money, 1877–1987: what the records show (memorandum ledger).
; Kept apart from the cash accounts in main.beancount. Each entry is money recorded between other parties about the farm and its land,
; with its catalogue ID. Where the records give no figure the entry is flagged ! with status "GAP" and carries 0.00 until a source is found.
; Pre-decimal sums are shown as written (e.g. 8s) and converted at 20s = £1 for the amount column. Ingredients and citations, not conclusions.
; Added 25 Oct 2026 from the research of that evening. — Sion's Tab agent
option "title" "Great House Farm (Tŷ Mawr) — the farm’s money, 1877–1987"
